import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 863 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Symbiotic Culture's Creation and Dissemination","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 863 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Symbiotic Culture's Creation and Dissemination","no":863,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Symbiotic Culture","New Culture","Dissemination","Values"],"related":["01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","848-Epic Creation","861-Cultural-Construction Overview","838-Myriad-Rank Knowledge Popularization"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0863_模块4-超脱者与文化-共生文化创造传播.md","filePath":"en/0863_模块4-超脱者与文化-共生文化创造传播.md"}`),a={name:"en/0863_模块4-超脱者与文化-共生文化创造传播.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,c,d){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-863-transcended-ones-and-culture-symbiotic-culture-s-creation-and-dissemination" tabindex="-1">Entry 863 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Symbiotic Culture&#39;s Creation and Dissemination <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-863-transcended-ones-and-culture-symbiotic-culture-s-creation-and-dissemination" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 863 | Transcended Ones and Culture | Symbiotic Culture&#39;s Creation and Dissemination&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 01, 838, 848, 861</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-myriad-ranks-need-a-new-common-language" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Myriad Ranks need a new &quot;common language&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-myriad-ranks-need-a-new-common-language" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Myriad Ranks need a new &quot;common language&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad Ranks each have their own culture, but to jointly build one cosmos, they need a &quot;common cultural base color&quot; above each clan — it does not replace each clan&#39;s traditions, but lets Myriad Ranks &quot;be able to converse&quot; spiritually. This is <strong>symbiotic culture.</strong> It distills the five axioms into values Myriad Ranks may feel, trust, and pass on. This entry explains: how the transcended one creates this new culture, and how he disseminates it to every corner of Myriad Ranks.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally embody — symbiotic culture is precisely these six axioms&#39; embodiment in the spiritual domain: <strong>anti-predation</strong> values, <strong>Myriad-Rank-republican</strong> identity, <strong>collective-uplift</strong> direction, <strong>causal-self-discipline</strong> reverence, <strong>law-first</strong> good faith, all condensed into symbiotic culture.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-what-is-symbiotic-culture" tabindex="-1">I. What Is Symbiotic Culture <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-what-is-symbiotic-culture" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. What Is Symbiotic Culture&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiotic culture is not another &quot;clan culture&quot;; it is Myriad Ranks&#39; <strong>common base color</strong>:</p><ul><li><strong>Core values</strong>: co-build and share, Myriad-Rank equality, increment creation, anti-predation;</li><li><strong>Common symbols</strong>: anchor, bidirectional circulation, the Alaya Network&#39;s public emblems;</li><li><strong>Common festivals</strong>: commemorate Myriad-Rank republicanism&#39;s establishment, celebrate common-uplift milestones;</li><li><strong>Common narrative</strong>: the &quot;we walked together&quot; sung by epic (entry 848).</li></ul><p>Its relationship to each clan&#39;s culture is &quot;base color and picture&quot; — each clan&#39;s culture is still a rich picture; symbiotic culture is the base color that lets all pictures hang together.</p><h2 id="ii-how-to-create-from-axioms-to-life" tabindex="-1">II. How to Create: From Axioms to Life <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-how-to-create-from-axioms-to-life" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. How to Create: From Axioms to Life&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiotic culture may not just shout slogans out of thin air; it must from axioms step by step land in life:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Layer</th><th>From Axiom to Symbiotic Culture</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Values</td><td>Anti-predation → &quot;robbing is losing&quot;; Myriad-Rank republicanism → &quot;we are equal&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Institutions</td><td>Every person has a path, more-work-more-pay, civilizational weight</td></tr><tr><td>Art</td><td>Civilizational aesthetics, epic, consciousness art</td></tr><tr><td>Daily</td><td>Festivals, customs, praise words in language</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Creating symbiotic culture is letting the five axioms, from charter text, seep into Myriad Ranks&#39; daily language, festivals, and aesthetics.</p><h2 id="iii-how-to-disseminate-culture-goes-to-the-countryside" tabindex="-1">III. How to Disseminate: Culture Goes to the Countryside <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-how-to-disseminate-culture-goes-to-the-countryside" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. How to Disseminate: Culture Goes to the Countryside&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Having created symbiotic culture, it must still be brought before Myriad Ranks. This is the same logic as entry 838 &quot;knowledge popularization&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Four-tier dissemination</strong>: enlightenment, entry, advanced, frontier, corresponding to different cognitive levels;</li><li><strong>Cross-lineage translation</strong>: translate symbiotic culture into forms perceptible to five-lineage life forms;</li><li><strong>Borrow daily carriers</strong>: naturally disseminate through education, epic, festivals, art, not relying on forced inculcation;</li><li><strong>Alaya traces</strong>: dissemination process does not manipulate or incite, under supervision.</li></ul><p><strong>Disseminating symbiotic culture is letting it &quot;grow out,&quot; not &quot;pour in.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="iv-symbiotic-culture-is-not-the-only-culture" tabindex="-1">IV. Symbiotic Culture Is Not the Only Culture <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-symbiotic-culture-is-not-the-only-culture" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Symbiotic Culture Is Not the Only Culture&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Be especially wary: symbiotic culture is a &quot;common base color,&quot; not &quot;the only culture.&quot; It does not replace each clan&#39;s tradition (entry 862), but lets multiple cultures have a basis for common dialogue. If symbiotic culture becomes &quot;the only correct culture,&quot; it degenerates into new cultural hegemony — this is what Heng Yuan Zhou firmly opposes.</p><p>Symbiotic culture&#39;s dissemination most fears two distortions. The first is &quot;fundamentalism&quot; — turning axioms into rigid dogma, requiring Myriad Ranks to express them in completely identical rituals, language, and festivals; as a result symbiotic culture instead becomes new cultural hegemony. The second is &quot;dilution&quot; — during dissemination, to please various audiences, softening the hard cores of anti-predation and Myriad-Rank republicanism into correct nonsense like &quot;everyone should be friendly.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s solution: the core may absolutely not be diluted; expression must be fully plural. The same axiom of &quot;universal equal infinite law for all beings&quot; may be composed into a symphony on a human plane, into wave-form poetry on a gas-form life plane, into a collective dream on a hive-mind plane — forms vary a thousand ways, the core does not move a bit. The transcended one during dissemination only assesses core fidelity, does not interfere with specific forms of expression.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: use common culture to organize Myriad Ranks&#39; spiritual force, forming synergy not internal friction</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: symbiotic culture from the heart layer confirms &quot;robbing is losing,&quot; more root-cure than law</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo civilization has no common culture, Myriad Ranks attack each other; Heng Yuan Zhou uses symbiotic culture to bind Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: symbiotic culture is translated per five lineages, facing all clans for dissemination</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: symbiotic culture&#39;s core, symbols, and dissemination mechanism all public and participable</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-symbiotic-culture-s-dissemination-supervision-and-self-consistency" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Symbiotic Culture&#39;s Dissemination Supervision and Self-Consistency <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-symbiotic-culture-s-dissemination-supervision-and-self-consistency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Symbiotic Culture&#39;s Dissemination Supervision and Self-Consistency&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Disseminating symbiotic culture must &quot;grow out&quot; not &quot;pour in.&quot; The whole dissemination process leaves traces under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: whether it is used to manipulate hearts, whether some clan is forced to accept, whether it conflicts with fundamental laws. Symbiotic culture&#39;s dissemination effect — Myriad Ranks&#39; recognition of co-building values — converts into the transcended one&#39;s civilizational weight. And the reason symbiotic culture may continuously grow is precisely because it obeys the law-first axiom: it does not conflict with fundamental laws; it continuously self-revises with Myriad Ranks&#39; life experience, yet always holds the anti-predation, Myriad-Rank-republican base color. The Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s spiritual base color is therefore both stable and vivid.</p><p>When disseminating symbiotic culture, Axiom 6 must be explained thoroughly: symbiosis is not forcing everyone to strive to the top, but letting everyone inherently possess a guaranteed infinity, each superimposing at their own rhythm — strivers may go higher, easygoing ones are not eliminated.</p><p>This is symbiotic culture&#39;s softest yet firmest base color — it does not eliminate anyone, only invites everyone at their own rhythm to flow into common uplift.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiotic culture&#39;s creation and dissemination is condensing the five axioms from charter text into Myriad Ranks&#39; common spiritual base color. It lets Myriad Ranks, while keeping their own traditions, possess a common identity of &quot;we are one&quot;; it naturally grows through education, epic, and festivals, not forced inculcation. When Myriad Ranks in daily life naturally believe &quot;co-building is better than predation, republicanism is better than autocracy,&quot; symbiosis internally transforms from institution into culture. This is the most far-reaching spiritual project the transcended one leaves Myriad Ranks.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/848_模块4-超脱者与艺术-史诗创作.html">Entry 848 · Epic Creation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/861_模块4-超脱者与文化-总论.html">Entry 861 · Cultural-Construction Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/838_模块4-超脱者与教育-万族知识普及.html">Entry 838 · Myriad-Rank Knowledge Popularization</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const y=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{h as __pageData,y as default};
